@startuml SD-3a
!include ../_style.iuml
title SD-3a (Software level, CSMS) — Charge Point loses connection mid-session, reconnects and the session is reconciled\nPrecondition: session is active on the Charge Point · System view: AD-3 · State: STM-1
footer Owner: Ngô Văn Minh Trí (WP2) · v2.0 · 01/11/2026 · names = code (apps/csms/src) · left gate = Charge Point [OCPP 1.6J, WSS]

participant "«component»\n<u>:OcppServer</u>" as OS
participant "«component»\n<u>:ConnectionRegistry</u>" as REG
participant "«component»\n<u>:OfflineGraceService</u>" as OG
participant "«component»\n<u>:ReplayDetector</u>" as RD
participant "«component»\n<u>:SessionsService</u>" as S
participant "«component»\n<u>:ReconciliationService</u>" as R

== Connection lost ==
[-> OS ++ : socket closed
OS -> REG ++ : close(client, closedAt) : Connection
REG -> REG : is_online = false, close epoch
REG --> OS -- : connection {chargePointId, epoch}
OS -> OG ++ : onSocketClosed(chargePointId, epoch, closedAt)
OG -> OG : schedule check after 120 s (grace)
OG --> OS --
deactivate OS

... offline grace period: 120 s ...
[o-> OG ++ : check(chargePointId, epoch)
alt reconnected within grace (newer epoch)
  OG -> OG : nothing to do, session stays active
else still offline
  OG -> S ++ : onStationOffline(chargePointId, at) : count
  S -> S : active / paused / stopping → orphaned\n(STATION_OFFLINE), void reservations
  S --> OG -- : orphaned sessions
  note right : Operator is alerted\nwithin 900 s (NFR-OCPP-07)
end
deactivate OG

== Charge Point reconnects and sends its stored messages ==
[-> OS ++ : reconnect [WSS, credential]
OS -> REG ++ : open(identity, client) : Connection
REG -> REG : new epoch, is_online = true
REG --> OS --
[<-- OS -- : connection accepted
[-> OS ++ : StopTransaction {transactionId, meterStop, timestamp, transactionData}
OS -> RD ++ : classify(cpTimestamp, receivedAt, epochOpenedAt) : ReplayVerdict
RD --> OS -- : replayed = true
OS -> S ++ : onStopTransaction(req, ctx)  (via OcppHandlers)
S -> R ++ : recordReplay(sessionId, frame)
R --> S --
S -> R ++ : evaluate(series, meterStop) : ReconciliationVerdict
R --> S -- : verdict
alt consistent, or gap explained by the offline window
  S -> S : orphaned → reconciled (RECONCILE_OK)
  note right : then settled as in SD-1b
else energy conflict
  S -> S : orphaned → review (RECONCILE_CONFLICT),\nbilling held until the Operator resolves it
end
S --> OS --
[<-- OS -- : StopTransaction.conf {Accepted}

... no reconnection 24 h after the session start ...
[o-> S ++ : at(start + 24 h)
S -> S : orphaned → review (HARD_CAP_EXCEEDED), billing held
deactivate S
note over OS, R : If live MeterValues arrive after reconnecting (the session is still running), the session goes orphaned → active (LIVE_MESSAGE) instead.\nThe 24 h trigger is in the state table but no job fires it yet (Trí).
@enduml
